      <EnumVal ord="-14">Card self-supervision detected a signal output relay coil failure. Replace the card in slot D.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-13">Card self-supervision detected a signal output relay coil failure. Replace the card in slot B.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-11">Card self-supervision detected a signal output relay coil failure. Replace the card in slot E.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-10">Card self-supervision detected a signal output relay coil failure. Replace the card in slot C.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="1">No action required</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="2">Try rebooting the relay. If the fault persists, try writing configuration again. Relay or some card(s) may need to be replaced.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="7">CPU card failure (File system). Relay may need to be replaced.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="8">IRF test activated. No action required.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="10">Watchdog resets have happened too frequently. Relay may need to be replaced.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="11">Check power supply unit and cables. Fix or replace if needed</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="80">CPU card failure (RAM). Relay may need to be replaced.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="81">CPU card failure (ROM). Relay may need to be replaced.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="82">CPU card failure (EEPROM). Relay may need to be replaced.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="83">CPU card failure (FPGA). Relay may need to be replaced.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="84">CPU card failure (RTC). Relay may need to be replaced.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="116">Card self-supervision has detected a fault in the communication card. Replace the card.</EnumVal>
    </EnumType>
