    <EnumType id="ABBIED600_Rev6_Health_Warning_Action">
      <EnumVal ord="-57">Abnormal signal from sensor(s) received. Check sensor and cabling for the faulty channel(s) of card in slot A1.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-56">Abnormal signal from sensor(s) received. Check sensor and cabling for the faulty channel(s) of card in slot G.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-55">Abnormal signal from sensor(s) received. Check sensor and cabling for the faulty channel(s) of card in slot F.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-54">Abnormal signal from sensor(s) received. Check sensor and cabling for the faulty channel(s) of card in slot D.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-53">Abnormal signal from sensor(s) received. Check sensor and cabling for the faulty channel(s) of card in slot B.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-52">Abnormal signal from sensor(s) received. Check sensor and cabling for the faulty channel(s) of card in slot A2.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-51">Abnormal signal from sensor(s) received. Check sensor and cabling for the faulty channel(s) of card in slot E.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-50">Abnormal signal from sensor(s) received. Check sensor and cabling for the faulty channel(s) of card in slot C.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-32">Check COM card SW version.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-27">External circuit overload or card malfunction in slot A1. Check the continuity and resistance of the external circuit.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-26">External circuit overload or card malfunction in slot G. Check the continuity and resistance of the external circuit.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-25">External circuit overload or card malfunction in slot F. Check the continuity and resistance of the external circuit.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-24">External circuit overload or card malfunction in slot D. Check the continuity and resistance of the external circuit.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-23">External circuit overload or card malfunction in slot B. Check the continuity and resistance of the external circuit.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-22">External circuit overload or card malfunction in slot A2. Check the continuity and resistance of the external circuit.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-21">External circuit overload or card malfunction in slot E. Check the continuity and resistance of the external circuit.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-20">External circuit overload or card malfunction in slot C. Check the continuity and resistance of the external circuit.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-17">Card self-supervision detected a temporary disturbance. If the warning persists, check environment and/or card in slot A1.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-16">Card self-supervision detected a temporary disturbance. If the warning persists, check environment and/or card in slot G.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-15">Card self-supervision detected a temporary disturbance. If the warning persists, check environment and/or card in slot F.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-14">Card self-supervision detected a temporary disturbance. If the warning persists, check environment and/or card in slot D.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-13">Card self-supervision detected a temporary disturbance. If the warning persists, check environment and/or card in slot B.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-12">Card self-supervision detected a temporary disturbance. If the warning persists, check environment and/or card in slot A2.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-11">Card self-supervision detected a temporary disturbance. If the warning persists, check environment and/or card in slot E.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="-10">Card self-supervision detected a temporary disturbance. If the warning persists, check environment and/or card in slot C.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="1">No action required</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="2">Try to reboot the relay, if warning persists try writing configuration again.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="7">Writing of a non-critical file has failed. Try to run factory restore. If the warning reoccurs, consider replacing the relay.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="10">The relay has rebooted due to self-supervision.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="11">Loss of or voltage dip in auxiliary power supply detected within last 5 minutes.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="20">Due to an warning in IEC 61850 configuration, communication is not running correctly. Check the configuration.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="22">Due to an warning in DNP3 configuration, communication is not running correctly. Check the configuration.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="24">Due to an warning in IEC 61850 dataset configuration, communication is not running correctly. Check the configuration.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="25">Due to an warning in IEC 61850 report control block conf., communication is not running correctly. Check the configuration.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="26">Due to an warning in IEC 61850 GOOSE control block conf., communication is not running correctly. Check the configuration.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="27">warning in relay configuration file. Possible solution is to rewrite the configuration to the relay.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="28">Application configuration (ACT) has too many connections. Optimize logic circuits.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="29">Application configuration (ACT) logic connection type mismatch. Check the ACT configuration.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="30">Check GOOSE input configuration.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="31">Check Application configuration (ACT).</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="32">Check relay GOOSE diagnostics.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="33">Mismatch in analog channel configuration within application configuration (ACT).</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="34">Check relay SMV diagnostics.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="35">Redundant Ethernet communication supervision has noticed loss of link on one of the comm. channels. Check Ethernet connections.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="36">Setting parameters and/or application configuration (ACT) invalid. Check settings and/or configuration.</EnumVal>
      <EnumVal ord="50">Check protection communication link and port and the remote-end relay compatibility.</EnumVal>
